    "t1-summarize-alice": "**Task t1\u2011summarize\u2011alice (Summarize my thread with\u202fAlice)**  \n\n*Thread ID:* `thr\u2011alice`  \n*Title:*\u202f\u201cQuarterly plan\u201d\n\n| Time | Sender | Message |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| 2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:12 | Alice | \u201cCan you review the quarterly plan before Friday?\u201d |\n| 2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:20 | You | \u201cSure \u2013 send the draft and I will look",
